---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ProjectInvitation from '../components/site/ProjectInvitation.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Stillroom" description="Stillroom is a small independent creative studio with plenty of soul.">
	<section class="about-philosophy">
		<div class="section-inner"><p class="eyebrow">About Stillroom</p></div>
		<h1>Small team.<br />Plenty of soul.</h1>
		<img src="/images/387-3526.webp" alt="Stillroom table collage" />
	</section>

	<section class="founder-story">
		<img src="/images/387-3529.webp" alt="Stillroom studio collage" />
		<div><p class="eyebrow">Our story</p><h2>It starts<br />with a feeling.</h2><p>Stillroom began with a simple belief: the places we remember are the ones that make us feel something. A warm welcome, a familiar ritual, a detail that feels considered.</p><p>We bring strategy, identity and digital together to help hospitality brands express that feeling clearly and carry it through every part of the experience.</p><a class="red" href="/contact">Start a conversation →</a></div>
	</section>

	<section class="team-section">
		<div class="section-inner team-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The people behind the work</p><h2 class="display-medium">Good company.</h2></div><p class="team-intro">A three-person team with a shared love of hospitality, close collaboration and work that feels as thoughtful as the places it represents.</p></div>
		<div class="team-grid">
			<article class="team-card"><div class="team-card__portrait" style="background-image:url('/images/387-3542.webp')"></div><h3>Alex Morgan</h3><p class="role">Founder / Creative direction</p><p>Alex brings a love of hospitality and a clear creative point of view to the studio, guiding every project from first conversation to final detail.</p></article>
			<article class="team-card"><div class="team-card__portrait" style="background-image:url('/images/387-3543.webp')"></div><h3>Maya Chen</h3><p class="role">Strategy / Design</p><p>Maya connects the story to the system, finding what makes a place distinctive and shaping identities with warmth, clarity and character.</p></article>
			<article class="team-card"><div class="team-card__portrait" style="background-image:url('/images/387-3544.webp')"></div><h3>Sam Rivera</h3><p class="role">Digital / Collaboration</p><p>Sam brings brands to life online, pairing thoughtful design with intuitive digital experiences that make every interaction feel considered.</p></article>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="principles arch-pattern">
		<div class="section-inner"><p class="eyebrow">What we value</p><h2 class="display-medium">Good work.<br />Good chemistry.</h2></div>
		<div class="principle-grid">
			<article><p class="eyebrow">01</p><h3>Character over convention.</h3><p>Every brand should feel like the place and people behind it, not a copy of the world around it.</p></article>
			<article><p class="eyebrow">02</p><h3>Design is better together.</h3><p>We work closely, share ideas early and make the strongest decisions as one team.</p></article>
			<article><p class="eyebrow">03</p><h3>Care in every detail.</h3><p>From first thought to final handover, the small things carry the feeling.</p></article>
			<article><p class="eyebrow">04</p><h3>Useful, not just beautiful.</h3><p>Every identity and digital experience should work hard in the real world.</p></article>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="proof"><p class="eyebrow">Selected proof</p><h2 class="display-medium">Made for people<br />who care.</h2><p class="lede" style="margin-inline:auto">Restaurants, hotels, cafés and food brands with character, ambition and a point of view.</p><a class="red proof-link" href="/work">Explore our work →</a><p class="eyebrow proof-clients-label">A few good connections / Sample clients</p><div class="proof-logos"><strong>Orlo House</strong><strong>Juniper</strong><strong>Fieldwork</strong><strong>The Long Table</strong><strong>Morrow</strong></div></section>

	<ProjectInvitation class="about-invitation" />
</Layout>
